{"unit_id":"zeranhub__dsh-context-shaping#card-zh","repo":"zeranhub/dsh-context-shaping","commit":"ad8fd8aac10b184b663b2ede8fb40d9bd7fbe461","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Context Shaping 是供 DSH Web 使用的会话上下文插件，可改写模型可见的历史。它提供 /shape 命令、shape_* 工具及消息操作按钮，支持分别编辑回复和思考链、删除或替换消息，并查看审计与撤销。适合需要调整后续模型上下文的 DSH 用户；需要 Web profile，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:287-302","lib/index.js:540-543","lib/client.js:490-512","lib/ops.js:292-310"]}
{"unit_id":"zeranhub__dsh-context-shaping#card-en","repo":"zeranhub/dsh-context-shaping","commit":"ad8fd8aac10b184b663b2ede8fb40d9bd7fbe461","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Context Shaping lets DSH Web users rewrite model-visible conversation history. Its /shape command, shape_* tools, and message controls can edit replies or reasoning, delete or replace messages, show an audit trail, and undo changes. A web profile is required; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:287-302","lib/index.js:540-543","lib/client.js:490-512","lib/ops.js:292-310"]}
