{"unit_id":"zeranhub__dsh-context-shaping#feature-1","repo":"zeranhub/dsh-context-shaping","commit":"ad8fd8aac10b184b663b2ede8fb40d9bd7fbe461","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Context Shaping 的功能「分部改写」：分别替换消息回复或思考链，可由 /shape 命令或 shape_edit 工具按节点序号触发，并保留其他内容块。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:287-302","lib/core.js:75-89"]}
{"unit_id":"zeranhub__dsh-context-shaping#feature-2","repo":"zeranhub/dsh-context-shaping","commit":"ad8fd8aac10b184b663b2ede8fb40d9bd7fbe461","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Context Shaping 的功能「替换对话区间」：把当前可见的连续节点替换成一条新消息。使用 shape_replace 工具或对应命令，输入起止序号、角色和文本；区间内原节点被影蔽，并记录在追加事件中。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:620-648","lib/ops.js:292-297"]}
{"unit_id":"zeranhub__dsh-context-shaping#feature-3","repo":"zeranhub/dsh-context-shaping","commit":"ad8fd8aac10b184b663b2ede8fb40d9bd7fbe461","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Context Shaping 的功能「审计与撤销」：查看改写记录并恢复被影蔽节点，可用 /shape history、/shape undo 或 shape_history、shape_restore，支持按节点或最近操作撤回。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:650-705","lib/ops.js:292-297"]}
{"unit_id":"zeranhub__dsh-context-shaping#feature-4","repo":"zeranhub/dsh-context-shaping","commit":"ad8fd8aac10b184b663b2ede8fb40d9bd7fbe461","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Context Shaping 的功能「Web 消息编辑」：在助手消息操作区提供改写回复、改写思考链、删除和还原按钮，并在输入区提供编辑最近一条用户消息的入口。点击后通过插件 HTTP API 获取或提交消息内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:490-512","lib/index.js:796-820"]}
{"unit_id":"zeranhub__dsh-context-shaping#caveat-1","repo":"zeranhub/dsh-context-shaping","commit":"ad8fd8aac10b184b663b2ede8fb40d9bd7fbe461","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Context Shaping 使用追加替换事件更新模型可见历史，原节点仍在会话事件日志中；区间替换撤销时会把原节点内容合并成一条消息，无法恢复原有分段。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/ops.js:278-297"]}
